    "summary": "Skye Kakoschke-Moore, a Nick Xenophon Team senator, announced her resignation from the Senate due to holding dual British citizenship by descent through her mother. She had always believed she was not British until recently receiving advice confirming her British citizenship. Kakoschke-Moore's mother, born in a former British colony, became a British citizen in 1983, which passed citizenship to Kakoschke-Moore by descent. She plans to have the matter referred to the high court to determine the vacancy filling process. A recount of the 2016 Senate election could likely elect the NXT candidate Tim Storrer to replace her. Nick Xenophon expressed his devastation at her resignation but believes it is not the end of her political career.",
